  "title": "Bermuda Spinach Salad",
  "description": "A smooth, tasty celery seed dressing is whipped up in the blender and poured over the luscious salad fixings - Bermuda onions, chopped spinach, hard boiled eggs, crumbled bacon, mushrooms and a smattering of croutons. Serves six.",
  "authors": [
    "Dee"
  ],
